Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:02.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向ZAFT軍艦Minerva通話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:06.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,貴艦正接近奧布聯合首長國的領海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我國不容許貴艦進入領海
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:12.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布  真打算…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:16.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.99,0:00:37.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:41.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戴上這個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:43.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是FAITH？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:48.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需對自己的信念和信義效忠便可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:54.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在需要的時候能挺身而出與之抗爭的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想必奧布的情況也讓你很擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.25,0:01:00.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你就去和Minerva會合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我對那艘船有很大期望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.27,0:01:09.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能發揮以前大天使號那樣的作用
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:12.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉 Savior出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,優しいその指が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終わりに触れる時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今だけ　君だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,信じてもいいだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰もが崩れてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願いを求めすぎて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分が堕ちてゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,場所を捜してる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傷つけて揺れるしか出来ない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ざわめく想いが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らの真実なら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壊れる地から動けない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,淋しい羽根重ねて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出逢う光の無い 時代の眩しさだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,変われる力恐れない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深い鼓動の先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交わす炎よ描かれた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命に届け
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE 13　甦醒的羽翼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.59,0:02:51.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷機　露娜瑪莉雅機收容完成
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse返航
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:59.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但願不會再有追擊　不過難說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之讓駕駛員休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑟　加緊掌握船艦受損情況
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:06.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:11.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,損傷控制　各部門立即報告情況
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:15.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs35\pos(642,668)}請盡快運送修理材料到第四後部倉庫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:16.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能殺出血路勿庸置疑多虧了真
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:19.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊　真難以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:23.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊沉了包括兩艘航母在內的六艘敵艦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我從沒聽說過這樣的數量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:28.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.97,0:03:38.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:39.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰果輝煌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:44.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會得勳章了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.07,0:03:47.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過沒想到那就是Impulse…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或者說是那孩子的力量呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.94,0:03:59.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直疑惑為什麼那台機體的駕駛員不是雷而是真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:04.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道狄蘭達爾議長連這種情況都考慮進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.25,0:04:06.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:10.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長本身就是DNA解析方面的專家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:14.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實在太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:18.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話我自己都沒想到那種情況下能夠脫身
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:22.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傳聞中雅金 多維的Freedom最多也不過如此了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:29.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抵達卡潘塔利亞後除了報告還必須考慮授勳的申請了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:33.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,軍總部也一定吃驚不小
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:36.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也該回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離卡潘塔利亞還遠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我說你著什麼魔了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然變成超級王牌駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,逆境中的潛力爆發？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:50.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看到奧布船開炮後特別生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.88,0:04:56.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想　怎麼能死在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:59.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,腦袋裡突然感覺特別安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:02.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就發飆了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:06.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　也不是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:08.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何 是你保護了船艦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,活著本身就是一種價值
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為還有明天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:29.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議會作出決定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:35.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1040,668)\fs40\fn华文中宋\b1\3c&H000000&}{\fad(100,300)}奧布連合首長國 首都
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.21,0:05:36.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,政府下周將正式加盟世界安全保障條約機構
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.15,0:05:49.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去世界將成為 兩個互不認可的集團無限爭鬥的戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:53.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們能滿意這樣的未來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:57.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看清戰爭的本質　卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:05:59.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,互相傷害不能結束任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:03.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,意氣行事  四處樹敵
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:07.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道與那個大國為敵是多危險的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,國家不是你的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:12.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再說感情用事的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:15.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:18.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡還是沒變啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:21.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和以前一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:25.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔們的墳墓也該整修整修了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:26.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道你在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.69,0:06:31.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣可不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:34.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一個保鏢都不帶就到處亂走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:36.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布國內雖然安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:39.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但形勢如此還是小心點好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:46.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:49.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有事才會特意來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:51.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:57.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,唉呀呀　你這種措辭得先改正一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為一國之母的你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:04.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總這樣的話 遲早會讓大家尷尬的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使現在還不至於
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:11.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我剛才在大叔們的墓前許下了諾言
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:17.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會用生命保護奧布和卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉　這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:21.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然倉促了些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:27.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儀式就安排在同盟條約簽訂的同一天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:32.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的情勢使國民也不免動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:40.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還可以借此表示我們首長齊心協力守衛奧布的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可以 稍等一下 尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:44.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:51.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子的時間結束了 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:55.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然早了些 而且有點可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我都是自然人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.21,0:08:03.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而奧布將和大西洋聯邦結成同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:07.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎樣都不可能了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟和他這種協調者生活的世界不同
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.59,0:08:13.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對著我喊也沒用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.59,0:08:20.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道想告訴國民不和我結婚隨他而去？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:26.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後再次站在PLANT一邊與大西洋聯邦為敵？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:27.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:36.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那以著阿斯哈之名拋棄國家和責任離家出走嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:44.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別誤會　我並非討厭協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.22,0:08:49.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但無論是他還是你弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.01,0:08:52.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都不能放在你身邊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:54.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:09:01.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是你作為奧布聯合首長國首長代表的立場
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:20.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服的風
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:21.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:27.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比昨天的煎得更深　不知如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:33.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是喜歡昨天的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:41.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,漸漸了解你的口味了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:49.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:53.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你請　女士優先
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:56.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　這種情況下該讓男士
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.56,0:10:06.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的決定雖然令人遺憾但也無可厚非
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:11.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　卡嘉莉應該也努力過了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:18.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種情勢下的政治對她這個18歲的女孩太難了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不打算指責她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,問題在於我們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.91,0:10:27.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:29.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們暫且不說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:34.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我、基拉和拉克絲還是做好搬家準備吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:37.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去PLANT？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:41.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也只剩那裡了　這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們協調者能居住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的話你也一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:56.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛收到那種宣戰佈告
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.76,0:11:01.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT的市民情緒雖然可能還比較激動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.03,0:11:06.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長卻意外地是個聰明人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:10.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會傻到排除自然人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:24.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能在某個地方過平和的生活直到老死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:26.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是最幸福的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:31.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到底還想要些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:54.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:57.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,決不能在現場留下她死去的痕跡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:00.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但要確實處理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:01.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會是哪邊的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她和孩子們拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:48.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去避難所
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:48.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:54.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:55.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快穿好衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有不速之客
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和拉米亞斯艦長一起照顧好拉克絲他們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:01.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:04.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.35,0:13:07.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快　大家都起床
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:11.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,噓　安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:12.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:14.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:25.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別靠近窗子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:26.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去避難所
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:27.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:32.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:34.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:36.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來　快走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:50.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:51.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:01.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:09.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉小姐　後面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標和小孩子們一起向E區域移動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有武器　護衛只有一個女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.93,0:14:57.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,盡快解決
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:06.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴爾特菲路特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:09.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來　快進去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:14.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快　人數太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:22.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:44.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:45.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:48.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是協調者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:51.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對　而且不是外行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:54.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,受過良好的戰鬥訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:56.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT軍…是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:16:00.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟派出協調者的特殊部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太差勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還難說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:07.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒想到會以她為目標
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:10.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.94,0:16:13.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什麼要對拉克絲…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:15.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:18.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟躲起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.37,注释SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,UMF/SSO-3 Ash : ZAFT特殊部隊最新銳水陸兩用MS
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出動Ash
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:21.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是迫不得已
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:23.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何都必須在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:26.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要了拉克絲 克萊茵的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:32.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.94,0:16:34.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴爾特菲路特隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:35.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:40.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們剛才的目標…是我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:59.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,集中攻擊避難所一處
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:01.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突破岩壁就能解決問題
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:12.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與其說剛才的目標　不如說現在的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.15,0:17:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:16.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖不知具體型號和數量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:23.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的火力之下　這裡也撐不了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.02,0:17:38.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲　你帶著鑰匙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:43.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開門吧　沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.25,0:17:48.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說你想讓大家就這麼坐以待斃嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:51.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.52,0:17:53.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:56.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:07.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:11.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我去開門好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　但這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:17.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:20.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事的　拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:22.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:25.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去　連你們都無法保護
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:29.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣會更令我痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:36.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以　把鑰匙給我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,3     2     1
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:32.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:35.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被突破了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:43.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好　上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:08.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找出目標
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.39,0:20:10.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧萊安和庫拉米克去…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:19.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:28.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那難道是…Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:01.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:56.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,言葉を重ねても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,理解り合えないこと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,まだ　知らなかったね
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君だけを抱きしめたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失くした夢　君は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「諦メナイデ」と云った
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遠く離れてるほどに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,近くに感じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,寂しさも　強さへと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,変換ってく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君を想ったなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,切なく胸を刺す
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それは夢の欠片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ありのまま　出逢えてた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,その奇跡　もう一度信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.28,0:23:23.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰火之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.48,0:23:25.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相信了那眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:26.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,相信了那雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.18,0:23:30.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此　才懷著夢想啟程
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.87,0:23:32.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而　夢醒時分
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.39,0:23:34.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,理想的世界並不在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.59,0:23:37.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗中獨自茫然佇立
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.65,0:23:39.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再次翱翔於天際的雙翼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:41.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將去向之處是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:45.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.33,0:23:46.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,往明日的啟航
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:48.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向著更遠的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:50.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊吧！Archangel
